'''Kimi''' is a [[Pixies|pixie]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found near the [[Lakeshore]] [[Cooking Table]]. She sells exclusively [[Archer]] [[Jobs|Job]] [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*{{Member}}[[Cross Wind Archer Quiver]]
*{{Member}}[[Cross Wind Archer Leggings]]
*{{Member}}[[Cross Wind Archer Cap]]
*{{Member}}[[Cross Wind Archer Gloves]]
*{{Member}}[[Cross Wind Archer Boots]]
*{{Member}}[[Cross Wind Archer Hoodie]]
*[[Archer's Power Shard of Vitality III]]
*[[Archer's Necklace of Vitality III]]
*[[Archer's Ring of Regeneration III]]
*[[Archer's Composite Bow of Splintering]]
*[[Archer's Composite Bow of Explosions]]
*[[Archer's Composite Bow of Volleys]]

